  "$D=\\{0\\le x\\le 1,\\ x^2\\le y\\le x\\}$. Vnútorný integrál podľa $y$ dá ${@0}\\left({@1}\\right)$, potom $\\displaystyle{@2}\\int_0^1\\left({@3}\\right)dx={@4}\\frac{1}{{@5}}={@6}$.": "$D=\\{0\\le x\\le 1,\\ x^2\\le y\\le x\\}$. L'integrale interno rispetto a $y$ dà ${@0}\\left({@1}\\right)$, poi $\\displaystyle{@2}\\int_0^1\\left({@3}\\right)dx={@4}\\frac{1}{{@5}}={@6}$.",
  "$D=\\{0\\le x\\le {@0},\\ 0\\le y\\le x\\}$. $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{{@1}}\\int_0^{x}({@2})\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^{{@3}}\\left({@4}\\right)dx={@5}\\cdot\\frac{{@6}^3}{3}={@7}$.": "$D=\\{0\\le x\\le {@0},\\ 0\\le y\\le x\\}$. $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{{@1}}\\int_0^{x}({@2})\\,dy\\,dx=\\int_0^{{@3}}\\left({@4}\\right)dx={@5}\\cdot\\frac{{@6}^3}{3}={@7}$.",
